# Vercel's uploader honours .gitignore, which excludes the brand fonts on
# purpose — this repo is public and the Graphik / TT Commons Pro EULAs cover
# serving from our own host, not redistribution in a public repo.
#
# That exclusion is right for git and wrong for deploy: without these files
# the deployed site falls back to a system sans and loses the whole brand
# voice. This file re-includes them and restates the other exclusions.

node_modules
.next
out
build
coverage
.DS_Store
*.pem
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*
.env*
.vercel
.cursor

# Figma exports and the investor one-pager. Reference material, never served,
# and design/ holds a PDF marked CONFIDENTIAL — keep it off the host.
design

# The fonts DO ship. Both lines are needed: the first re-includes the
# directory, the second its contents.
!public/fonts
!public/fonts/**
